#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:50
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're using this setting to work around an application that demands "
"attention too often, first look for a setting in the app to disable that "
"behavior. If you don't find one, consider reporting this as a bug to the "
"app's developer."
msgstr ""
"Más rud é go bhfuil an socrú seo á úsáid agat chun dul timpeall ar "
"fheidhmchlár a éilíonn aird rómhinic, lorg socrú san aip ar dtús chun an "
"t-iompar sin a dhíchumasú. Mura bhfaighidh tú ceann, smaoinigh ar é seo a "
"thuairisciú mar fhabht d'fhorbróir na haipe."

#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:98
msgctxt "@info displayed as InlineMessage"
msgid ""
"The compositor does not support displaying windows side by side, so a "
"textual list will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an cumadóir le fuinneoga a thaispeáint taobh le taobh, mar sin "
"taispeánfar liosta téacsúil ina ionad."

